- Class 1 examples generally show temperatures above 60, vibration around mid-40s to low-50s, power usage above 9, and humidity above 30.  
- Machine_Type alone does not clearly separate classes but is included for completeness.  
- Conditions overlap in ranges but combined they can help differentiate risk.

